  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How to read this view",
      "items": [
        "Each row is an independent guarded transition, not a chronological sequence across rows. Repeated phase labels name the same underlying phase; aliases prevent unrelated rules from sharing ambiguous drawing corridors. The normal-procedure view supplies the connected happy path."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reading this view",
      "items": [
        "snake_case labels are real session.phase strings. Nodes in the 'conceptual step' legend group, or with tag 'conceptual'/'phase group', are not phase strings.",
        "Pilot calls move a phase only after telemetry confirms the claim (_at_hold, _at_crossing, _lined_up). Take-off, landing and vacating come from the mission track alone (airfield.py 44-50)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Crossing rules",
      "items": [
        "A crossing request needs a runway designator that exists and an observed position holding short of it (airfield.py 1758-1765). Allowed from taxi, holding_short, crossing_requested or taxi_in (1759).",
        "The crossing uses the airfield's single movement lane, under the same grant rules as line-up and landing (1072-1074).",
        "The phase returns to session.resume (taxi or taxi_in) once telemetry shows the aircraft entered the runway and then cleared all runways (864-869), or when the pilot reports vacated and telemetry agrees (1782-1787).",
        "The lane is freed when the crossing is complete (1774). Revoked crossings appear in the revocations view."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Transition evidence (file lines)",
      "items": [
        "taxi/holding_short \u2192 crossing_requested: pilot call + _at_crossing (1758-1770)",
        "crossing_requested \u2192 crossing_clearance: scheduler (1072-1074)",
        "crossing_clearance \u2192 crossing: readback 1717",
        "crossing \u2192 resume: entered, then clear of runways; resumes taxi (864-869, 1772-1780); resume = taxi_in (1775-1778)",
        "taxi_in \u2192 crossing_requested: allowed by 1759",
        "pre-runway phase \u2192 taxi_in_clearance: pilot call, ground here (1807-1810, 1622-1634); phase list 1808-1809",
        "taxi_in \u2192 startup: ground, no lane, off runway (1583-1587)"
      ]
    }
  ]
